  "remarks": "PJSC Slavneft-Megionneftegaz is a Russian company active in the energy sector. PJSC Slavneft-Megionneftegaz engages in oil refining and is part of the structure of PJSC Slavneft. The energy sector, especially the oil and gas sectors, provides a substantial source of revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation. Therefore, PJSC Slavneft- Megionneftegaz is involved in an economic sector providing a substantial source of revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation, which is responsible for the annexation of Crimea and the destabilisation of Ukraine.",
